      "failureMode": "D4 and A06 claim frozen native preview/dirty-frame recovery, but A05 specifies only a fixed fixture Date at04:30Z, and the generic environment omits simTime/timeScale for live recovery. Fixed Date in the no-override branch still has FOLLOW_WALL_CLOCK=true/TIMESCALE=1; it is a constant-wall fixture rather than the explicit frozen preview branch. Thus an executor can label that passing scene frozen without reaching the claimed native mode. This does not reopen accepted source row7.07; it clarifies the new native claim under7.15.",
      "sourceEvidence": [
