        "https://github.com/theislampill/salah_widget/issues/7#issuecomment-6073061264"
      ],
      "smallestCorrection": "Specify a separate actual frozen overnight-recovery lane before natural boot: NewYork tz, pre-scriptDate2026-03-08T04:30Z (localMarch7), simTime=23:30 with timeScale omitted, native performance/rAF/timers retained. Read TIMESCALE=0,FOLLOW_WALL_CLOCK=false,ADVANCING=false and identical epoch before/after real matchingMar8 prefetch settlement, no clock/manual-render calls; first native dirty frame restores270m and12/24h. Bind A05/A06/environment metadata and comment. Keep no-simTime/timeScale rule for the separate normal live-motion/recovery control. A unique current23:30 allows actual future endpoint gap/fold controls without invalidating the whole scene.",
      "recheck": "Read-only hash-bound review of recipe/flags/environment/acceptance and synchronized comment/metadata; no runtime execution required in this stage.",
